Third-party components NOT included in this repository
-----------------------------------------------------

CIBERSORT.R and the LM22 signature matrix are NOT distributed here. They are
made available by the Alizadeh/Newman laboratory (Stanford University) under a
license that prohibits redistribution of those files. The scripts in this
repository only *call* locally obtained copies. Users must register at
https://cibersortx.stanford.edu/ and download CIBERSORT.R and LM22.txt
themselves, then place them in the working directory before running
04b_cibersort.R. See README.md for details.
